# Settings > Updates > Packages (report 047 P4): how an upgrade ends, on the Pi 4 B's capture. Cancel while downloading
# (the row, then the flag file the helper reads: "Cancelling the download"), the result "Cancelled"; an upgrade with the
# launcher libraries that advises a restart (libc6: never an automatic reboot); a failed install with the last lines of the
# helper's log readable; the helper refusing (its own battery check): "did not start". Keys only. Review only: no golden.
title updates upgrade results
review
sizes 640x480 480x800 480x640 720x720 1280x800 480x320
@480x800,480x640 profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env HARNESS_APPS missing
env HARNESS_SUDO ok
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30 2026-11-01
wifi 70
bt on
update net on
update build 0.9.2 release arm64
update answer releases-real.json
update log apt-upgrade-failed.log
apt board pi4b
apt lists-age 1
home
launch Settings
wait 300
key UP
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
wait 3000
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 1500
# 1. cancelled while downloading
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
key END
key UP
key ENTER
wait 600
apt upgrade job upgrade
apt upgrade state running
apt upgrade phase download
apt upgrade done 3
apt upgrade total 16
apt upgrade percent 18
apt upgrade started now-0
apt upgrade log /var/log/cyberdeckzero/apt-upgrade-20261101-203100.log
wait 1500
key END
key ENTER
wait 600
shot upgrade_cancelling
expect_text "Cancelling the download"
expect_unclipped "Check the plan" "Download" "Install" "Clean up" "Cancelling the download"
apt expect-cancel yes
apt upgrade state cancelled
apt upgrade phase clean
apt upgrade reason the download was cancelled: nothing was installed
wait 1500
shot upgrade_result_cancelled
key ESC
wait 1500
# 2. done with the launcher libraries: a restart advised
apt upgrade clear
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
key ENTER
wait 300
key END
key UP
key ENTER
wait 600
apt upgrade job upgrade
apt upgrade state done
apt upgrade phase clean
apt upgrade done 20
apt upgrade total 20
apt upgrade percent 100
apt upgrade libraries 1
apt upgrade reboot 1
apt upgrade reboot_why libc6
apt upgrade started now-0
apt upgrade log /var/log/cyberdeckzero/apt-upgrade-20261101-203300.log
wait 1500
shot upgrade_result_reboot
header upgrade_result_reboot "Settings > Updates > Packages > Upgrade" "Updates > Packages > Upgrade" "Packages > Upgrade" Upgrade
key ESC
wait 1500
# 3. the install failed: the reason, the end of the log
apt upgrade clear
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
key END
key UP
key ENTER
wait 600
apt upgrade job upgrade
apt upgrade state failed
apt upgrade phase clean
apt upgrade done 2
apt upgrade total 16
apt upgrade reason E: Sub-process /usr/bin/dpkg returned an error code (1); dpkg has unfinished packages: Repair finishes them
apt upgrade started now-0
apt upgrade log /var/log/cyberdeckzero/apt-upgrade-20261101-203500.log
wait 1500
shot upgrade_result_failed
key END
wait 400
shot upgrade_result_failed_log
key ESC
wait 1500
# 4. the helper refused (its own guard: the battery fell under 50 % while the page was open)
apt upgrade clear
key DOWN
key ENTER
wait 600
key END
key UP
key ENTER
wait 600
apt upgrade job upgrade
apt upgrade state refused
apt upgrade phase check
apt upgrade total 16
apt upgrade reason battery 30 %: charge it or plug it in
apt upgrade started now-0
apt upgrade log /var/log/cyberdeckzero/apt-upgrade-20261101-203700.log
wait 1500
shot upgrade_result_refused
key ESC
key ESC
key ESC
wait 300
